", "text": "Hydroxyproline levels and AT were significantly better in B subgroups. PURPOSE MATERIAL AND METHODS RESULTS Adhesives Anastomosis, Surgical Animals Cyanoacrylates Intestines Polyglactin 910 Rats Rats, Sprague-Dawley Tensile Strength Wound Healing y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

