", "text": "There were no significant differences comparing OA by age. BACKGROUND METHODS RESULTS Aged Clinical Protocols Clinical Trials, Phase I as Topic Female Health Status Humans Life Expectancy Male Middle Aged Neoplasms Pain Patient Admission Patient Selection Pilot Projects Quality of Life Research Design Retrospective Studies y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

