", "text": "Other socio-demographic characteristics were not associated with performance. These interim findings provide a sound base for the ongoing study. OBJECTIVE MATERIALS AND METHODS RESULTS AND DISCUSSION Achievement Adult Chi-Square Distribution Clinical Competence College Admission Test Educational Measurement Female Humans Interviews as Topic Longitudinal Studies Male New Zealand Predictive Value of Tests School Admission Criteria Students, Dental y e s n o", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

