", "text": "The D2 receptor occupancies showed a dose-dependent increase, never exceeding 80%; at all doses 5-HT2 occupancy exceeded D2 occupancy. BACKGROUND METHODS RESULTS Adult Amoxapine Brain Female Humans Male Psychotic Disorders Receptors, Dopamine D2 Receptors, Serotonin Tomography, Emission-Computed y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

