", "text": "Both findings were not statistically significant after adjustment for multiple testing. PURPOSE MATERIALS AND METHODS RESULTS Age Factors Animals Bone and Bones Child Disease Models, Animal Fractures, Bone Fractures, Closed Fractures, Comminuted Growth Plate Humans Image Processing, Computer-Assisted Imaging, Three-Dimensional Intra-Articular Fractures Salter-Harris Fractures Sensitivity and Specificity Swine Tomography, Spiral Computed Ultrasonography y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

