", "text": "In the reversal phase, we did not find any significant difference between groups. OBJECTIVE METHOD RESULTS Animals Astrocytes Disease Models, Animal Immune Tolerance Immunity, Cellular Immunity, Innate Learning Disorders Male Maze Learning Memory Disorders Mice Mice, Inbred BALB C Microglia Neuroimmunomodulation Neurotoxins Solvents T-Lymphocytes Toluene y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

