", "text": "In October, the BPPV group showed increased values for all of the viruses studied, compared to the control group. OBJECTIVES METHODS RESULTS Adolescent Adult Aged Antibodies, Viral Benign Paroxysmal Positional Vertigo Child Female Follow-Up Studies Humans Incidence Male Middle Aged Retrospective Studies Turkey Virus Diseases Viruses Young Adult y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

