", "text": "The remaining influence of GDP is positive in both models. BACKGROUND METHODS RESULTS Employment Europe Female Humans Male Risk Factors Sex Distribution Social Distance Social Welfare Socioeconomic Factors Suicide y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

