", "text": "Intense postoperative pain can favor the development of refractory chronic pain. PURPOSE OF THE STUDY MATERIAL AND METHODS RESULTS DISCUSSION Acetaminophen Adolescent Adult Aged Analgesia, Patient-Controlled Analgesics, Non-Narcotic Anxiety Depression Female Follow-Up Studies Forecasting Humans Life Change Events Male Medical History Taking Middle Aged Morphine Narcotics Pain Measurement Pain, Postoperative Prospective Studies Shoulder Joint y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

