", "text": "None of the additional evaluated imaging parameters on unenhanced MRI proved reliable in differentiating these diagnoses. BACKGROUND OBJECTIVE MATERIALS AND METHODS RESULTS Acute Disease Adolescent Anemia, Sickle Cell Bone and Bones Child Child, Preschool Diagnosis, Differential Female Humans Infant Magnetic Resonance Imaging Male Osteomyelitis Retrospective Studies n o n o", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

