", "text": "In the lower cervical region, no single connective tissue sheet extended directly between the sternocleidomastoid muscles. The fascial structure deep to platysma in the anterior cervical triangle comprised the strap fascia. BACKGROUND METHODS RESULTS Aged Aged, 80 and over Cervical Plexus Collagen Connective Tissue Epoxy Compounds Female Humans Male Microscopy, Confocal Neck Neck Muscles Plastic Embedding y e s n o", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

