", "text": "The diagnostic yield was 75% (33/44 cases) and therapeutic yield was 63.6%. No major complications were observed, only minor complication such as sore throat in 4/44 (9.1%). BACKGROUND AND STUDY AIMS PATIENTS AND METHODS RESULTS Adult Aged Aged, 80 and over Catheterization Endoscopy, Gastrointestinal Female Humans Intestinal Diseases Intestine, Small Male Middle Aged Time Factors y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

