", "text": "Peak levels of MEGX were significantly higher (P ≤ 0.0001) at 250 µm (0.048 mg/L), compared to 500 µm (0.018 mg/L), 50 µm (0.036 mg/L), and 25 µm (0.0144 mg/L). BACKGROUND AND OBJECTIVE MATERIALS AND METHODS RESULTS Administration, Cutaneous Anesthetics, Local Animals Drug Delivery Systems Lasers, Solid-State Lidocaine Skin Absorption Swine y e s y e s", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

